"""정면 자세를 유지하며 오른팔꿈치·손목6축만 타현하는 실제14초 실행."""
import isaacgym
import argparse
import json
from pathlib import Path
from unittest.mock import patch
from ..lower_body_release_v1 import run_horizontal_v7 as runner, scene_v8, controller_horizontal_v4
from ..lower_body_release_v1.common import ROOT, A, BASE, pin, verify, read, save, sha
from .. import string_trial_recording_v1 as strings
from .runtime_v1 import Scene, Controller, PROTOCOL
from ..front_facing_pose_v1.release_prepare_v2 import validate_reference
from ..front_facing_pose_v1.recording_v1 import ThinStringTrialRecording

PHASE = BASE/'front_facing_strike_v1'
PLANS = [ROOT/'docs/plans/front_facing_strike_20261016.md']


def compact_native_save(path, value):
    path = Path(path)
    if path.name not in ('states240.json', 'contacts240.json', 'efforts240.json', 'targets60.json'):
        return save(path, value)
    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
    with path.open('x') as stream:
        json.dump(value, stream, separators=(',', ':'), allow_nan=False)
        stream.write('\n')


def main(config, out):
    config, out = Path(config).resolve(), Path(out).resolve()
    assert out.parent == PHASE and not out.exists()
    cfg = read(config)
    assert cfg['seconds'] == 14 and cfg['mode'] == 'static'
    assert cfg['validation_protocol'] == PROTOCOL
    assert cfg['play_case'] in ('baseline', 'strike') and cfg['play_start_s'] == 10
    assert cfg['play_action_interval_s'] == [10, 14]
    assert cfg['preparation_s'] == 5 and cfg['hold_interval_s'] == [5, 10]
    assert cfg['chest_extra_goal_depth_m'] == .00025
    source = Path(cfg['candidate']).resolve().parent
    report_path = Path(cfg['source_report']).resolve()
    report = read(report_path)
    assert report['eligible_for_native'] and report['inputs_unchanged']
    assert verify(read(source/'inputs_before.json'))
    assert sha(cfg['candidate']) == cfg['candidate_sha256']
    assert report['source_candidate_sha256'] == cfg['candidate_sha256']
    posture_path = Path(cfg.get('posture_target_report', cfg['source_report'])).resolve()
    posture = read(posture_path)
    assert posture['eligible_for_native_target'] and posture['inputs_unchanged']
    assert verify(read(posture_path.parent/'inputs_before.json'))
    assert sha(cfg['upper_target105']) == cfg['upper_target105_sha256'] == posture['target_sha256']
    assert cfg['candidate_sha256'] == posture['source_candidate_sha256']
    assert Path(cfg['candidate']).resolve() == Path(posture['source_candidate']).resolve()
    assert Path(cfg['upper_target105']).resolve() == posture_path.parent/'upper_target105.json'
    extras = PLANS+[report_path, source/'inputs_before.json', posture_path,
                    posture_path.parent/'inputs_before.json', Path(cfg['upper_target105']),
                    Path(read(cfg['candidate'])['support_candidate']), A/'AGENTS.md']
    for package in ('grounded_guitar_support_v1', 'grounded_guitar_play_v1', 'seated_foot_support_v1', 'front_facing_pose_v1', 'front_facing_strike_v1'):
        extras += list((A/package).glob('*.py'))
    for kind, eligible, filename in (
        ('finite_right_goal', 'eligible_for_finite_human_goal', 'right_goal_spec.json'),
        ('hip_load_bias', 'eligible_for_finite_hip_load_bias', 'hip_load_bias_spec.json')):
        report_file = Path(cfg[kind+'_report']).resolve()
        spec_file = Path(cfg[kind+'_spec']).resolve()
        evidence, spec = read(report_file), read(spec_file)
        assert evidence[eligible] and evidence['inputs_unchanged']
        assert verify(read(report_file.parent/'inputs_before.json'))
        assert sha(spec_file) == cfg[kind+'_spec_sha256'] == evidence['spec_sha256']
        assert evidence['source_candidate_sha256'] == spec['initial_candidate_sha256'] == cfg['candidate_sha256']
        assert spec_file == report_file.parent/filename
        extras += [report_file, spec_file, report_file.parent/'inputs_before.json']
    assert cfg['hip_load_bias_mode'] == 'finite_constant_native_RHip_load_bias_v1'
    preflight_path = Path(cfg['play_preflight_report']).resolve()
    preflight = read(preflight_path)
    spec_path = Path(cfg['play_spec']).resolve()
    assert sha(preflight_path) == cfg['play_preflight_report_sha256']
    assert preflight['eligible_for_native'] is True and preflight['inputs_unchanged'] is True
    assert preflight['source_candidate_sha256'] == cfg['candidate_sha256']
    assert sha(spec_path) == cfg['play_spec_sha256'] == preflight['spec_sha256']
    assert spec_path == preflight_path.parent/'play_spec.json'
    assert verify(read(preflight_path.parent/'inputs_before.json'))
    certificate_path = Path(cfg['prepared_repeat_certificate']).resolve()
    reference, repeat = (Path(cfg[k]).resolve() for k in ('prepared_reference_run', 'prepared_repeat_run'))
    cert, analyses, summaries, exact, static_config = validate_reference(reference, repeat, certificate_path)
    assert static_config == Path(cfg['prepared_static_config']).resolve()
    assert sha(static_config) == cfg['prepared_static_config_sha256'] == preflight['prepared_static_config_sha256']
    assert preflight['reference_run'] == str(reference) and preflight['repeat_run'] == str(repeat)
    assert preflight['repeat_verification_path'] == str(certificate_path)
    assert preflight['repeat_verification_sha256'] == sha(certificate_path)
    assert read(spec_path)['source_candidate_sha256'] == cfg['candidate_sha256']
    assert read(spec_path)['repeat_verification_sha256'] == sha(certificate_path)
    # 새 실행 시간·동작 항목을 제외한 원 제어 설정은 인증한 정지 설정과 같다.
    added = {'seconds', 'validation_protocol', 'play_case', 'play_start_s', 'play_action_interval_s',
             'play_preflight_report', 'play_preflight_report_sha256', 'play_spec', 'play_spec_sha256',
             'prepared_static_config', 'prepared_static_config_sha256', 'prepared_reference_run',
             'prepared_repeat_run', 'prepared_repeat_certificate'}
    assert {k:v for k,v in cfg.items() if k not in added} == {k:v for k,v in read(static_config).items() if k not in added}
    extras += [preflight_path, preflight_path.parent/'inputs_before.json', spec_path, certificate_path, static_config]
    extras += list(cert['input_sha256']) + list(preflight['input_sha256'])
    inputs = pin(config, extra=extras)
    # 보고서가 소비한 코드·원자료·XML/모든 선언 mesh까지 입력 map에 닫는다.
    for before in (source/'inputs_before.json', posture_path.parent/'inputs_before.json',
                   Path(cfg['finite_right_goal_report']).parent/'inputs_before.json',
                   Path(cfg['hip_load_bias_report']).parent/'inputs_before.json', preflight_path.parent/'inputs_before.json'):
        for path, expected in read(before).items():
            assert path not in inputs or inputs[path] == expected
            inputs[path] = expected
    assert verify(inputs)
    before = PHASE/'provenance'/(out.name+'_before.json')
    save(before, inputs)
    try:
        with patch.object(strings, 'StringTrialRecording', ThinStringTrialRecording), \
             patch.object(scene_v8, 'Scene', Scene), \
             patch.object(controller_horizontal_v4, 'Controller', Controller), \
             patch.object(runner, 'save', compact_native_save):
            runner.run(config, out)
    finally:
        save(out/'support_wrapper.json', dict(input_sha256=inputs, inputs_unchanged=verify(inputs),
            before_manifest=str(before), actual_scene_class='front_facing_strike_v1.runtime_v1.Scene',
            controller='front_facing_strike_v1.runtime_v1.Controller',
            play_case=cfg['play_case'], finger_motion_class='front_facing_strike_v1.motion_v1.Motion',
            prepared_reference_run=str(reference), prepared_repeat_run=str(repeat),
            prepared_repeat_certificate=str(certificate_path),
            validation_protocol=cfg['validation_protocol'], image_capture_hz=5,
            camera_matrix_telemetry_hz=30, physical_seconds=14,
            native_raw_encoding='Compact JSON; all numeric values, fields and array order retained.',
            scope='실제14초: 준비0..5/정지5..10/대조 또는 distal6 타현10..14. 10초 전 원 정면제어를 유지하며 이후2396 제출R12 목표를 유지하고 팔꿈치·손목6축만 추가 요청. 근위6 요청/최종목표를 전행 검사. R12 IK는10초부터 중지하고 원 world material human task·Chest·Hip bias·유한PD·발정면 IK는 유지. 기타 자유/중력ON/스트랩OFF, 원물성·105채널·영범위8축 보존. 기타힘/고정/부착/상태주입/PPO 없음. Source 도달은 실제 타현·지지 성공이 아니며 RH:pick/줄은 비충돌 기하 표식.'))
    assert verify(inputs)


if __name__ == '__main__':
    p = argparse.ArgumentParser()
    p.add_argument('--config', type=Path, required=True)
    p.add_argument('--out', type=Path, required=True)
    args = p.parse_args()
    main(args.config, args.out)
